because of subsection 116(7), the institution
continues to be a participating institution in relation to a person who made
an application for redress before the revocation;

A State does not cease to be a participating
State because of the termination of its amendment reference
if:

the matter of the release or discharge, in
connection with the operation of the scheme, of relevant civil liability of
institutions or officials;

the matter of the disclosure or use of evidence
or other information provided or obtained in connection with the operation of
