a participating government institution is equally
responsible with a defunct institution for abuse of a person;
and

the government institution is the funder of last
resort for the defunct institution in relation to the
abuse;

apply subsection 30(2) as if the defunct
institution were also a responsible institution in relation to the abuse;
and

had the Operator been notified as required, the
amount that was paid to the recipient would not have been
payable;

after giving 28 days’ notice to the person
